WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Markup in the admin menu lists every comment. The menu shows how many are open.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Review links lists every link, for one page or the whole site, with Turn off.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.500
View on page scrolls to the block, outlines it and shows the comment.

00:10.500 --> 00:15.500
Settings > Easy Markup sets the accent, button and button text colors.
